msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "សេចក្ដី​ណែនាំ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kpdf; is a &kde; <firstterm>PDF</firstterm> (Portable Document Format) "
#| "viewer based on the code of the xpdf application. Although being based on "
#| "xpdf code, &kpdf; has some unique features such as continuous mode and "
#| "presentation support."
msgid ""
"&okular; is a &kde; universal document viewer based on the code of the "
"&kpdf; application. Although being based on &kpdf; code, &okular; has some "
"unique features such as overview mode, improved presentation support and "
"annotation support."
msgstr ""
"Kpdf គឺ​ជា KDE <firstterm>PDF</firstterm> (Portable Document Format) កម្មវិធី​មើល​"
"ដែល​ផ្នែក​លើ​កូដ​នៃ​កម្មវិធី xpdf ។ ទោះបី​ជា​កំពុង​បាន​ត្រូវ​ផ្អែក​លើ​កូដ xpdf Kpdf មាន​លក្ខណៈ​ពិសេស​តែ​មួយ​"
"ដូច​ជា​របៀប​បន្ត និង​ការ​គាំទ្រ​ការ​បង្ហាញ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening Files"
msgstr "កំពុង​បើក​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To view a PDF file in &kpdf;, select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
#| "guimenu><guimenuitem>Open... </guimenuitem></menuchoice>, choose a PDF or "
#| "PS file in the dialogue and click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>. Your file "
#| "should now be displayed in the main window."
msgid ""
"To view any supported file in &okular;, select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, choose a supported "
"file in the dialog and click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>. Your file should "
"now be displayed in the main window."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​មើល​ឯកសារ PDF ក្នុង Kpdf ជ្រើស <menuchoice><guimenu>ឯកសារ</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>បើក... </guimenuitem></menuchoice> ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ PDF ឬ PS "
"ក្នុង​ប្រអប់ និង​ចុច <guibutton>បើក</guibutton> ។ ឯកសារ​របស់​អ្នក​គួរ​តែ​​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​"
"មេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have already opened files in &kpdf; before, you can quickly access "
#| "them by selecting them in the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
#| "guimenu><guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgid ""
"If you have already opened files in &okular; before, you can quickly access "
"them by selecting them in the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​បាន​បើក​ឯកសារ​រួច​ហើយ​ក្នុង Kpdf ពី​មុន អ្នក​អាច​ចូល​ដំណើរ​ការ​ពួក​វា​យ៉ាង​រហ័ស​ដោយ​ជ្រើស​ពួក​វា​ក្នុង​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ឯកសារ</guimenu><guisubmenu>បើក​ថ្មីៗ</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "After having a file opened you probably want to read it and therefore "
#| "navigate through it. Click Next to learn more about this."
msgid ""
"After having a file opened you probably want to read it and therefore "
"navigate through it. Go to the <link linkend=\"navigating\">next section</"
"link> to learn more about this."
msgstr ""
"បន្ទាប់​ពី​មាន​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បើក អ្នក​ប្រហែល​ជា​ចង់​អាន​វា និង​មិន​តែ​ប៉ុណ្ណោះ​រុករក​តាម​រយៈ​វា ។ ចុច​បន្ទាប់​ដើម្បី​"
"រៀន​បន្ថែម​អំពី​នេះ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating"
msgstr "ការ​រុករក"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This section describes how you can navigate through a document in &kpdf;."
msgid ""
"This section describes how you can navigate through a document in &okular;."
msgstr "ផ្នែក​នេះ​ពណ៌នា​របៀប​ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​រុករក​តាម​រយៈ​ឯកសារ​ជា Kpdf ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways of scrolling the viewing area. One is to use the "
"<keycap>Up Arrow</keycap> and <keycap>Down Arrow</keycap> keys. You may also "
"use the scrollbar, your mousewheel or the <keycap>Page Up</keycap> and "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap> keys."
msgstr ""
"មាន​វិធី​ច្រើន​ដើម្បី​រមូរ​ផ្ទៃ​ដែល​មើល ។ វិធី​មួយ​គឺ​ប្រើ​គ្រាប់​ចុច <keycap>ព្រួញ​ឡើង</keycap> និង "
"<keycap>ព្រួញ​ចុះ</keycap> ។ អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​របារ​រមូរ កង់​កណ្ដុរ​របស់​អ្នក ឬ​គ្រាប់​ចុច <keycap>ទំព័រ​"
"លើ</keycap> និង <keycap>ទំព័រ​ចុះ</keycap> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another way is to hold the &LMB; down at any place on the document while "
"dragging the mouse in the opposite direction of where you want to move. This "
"procedure only works if the Browse Tool is enabled, which you can select by "
"choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Browse Tool </"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"វិធី​មួយ​ទៀត​គឺ​សង្កត់​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​នៅ​កន្លែង​ណា​មួយ​លើ​ឯកសារ ខណៈ​កំពុង​អូស​កណ្ដុរ​ក្នុង​ទិស​បញ្ច្រាស​នៃ​កន្លែង​ដែល​"
"អ្នក​ចង់​ផ្លាស់ទី ។ បែបបទ​នេះ​ធ្វើការ​តែ​បើ​ឧបករណ៍​រក​មើល​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ដោយ​ជ្រើស "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ឧបករណ៍</guimenu><guimenuitem>ឧបករណ៍​រក​មើល</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The navigation panel on the left side of the screen enables two more ways of "
"navigating through a document:"
msgstr "បន្ទះ​រុករក​នៅ​លើ​ជ្រុង​ខាង​ឆ្វេង​នៃ​អេក្រង់ អនុញ្ញាត​វិធី​ពីរ​បន្ថែម​នៃការ​រុករក​តាម​រយៈ​ឯកសារ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on a page thumbnail the viewing area will be brought to that "
"page."
msgstr "បើ​អ្នក​ចុច​លើ​រូប​ភាព​តូច ផ្ទៃ​ដែល​មើល​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​នាំ​ទៅ​ទំព័រ​នោះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:124
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If the document has a table of contents, clicking on a table of contents "
#| "item will bring the document to to the page linked to that item."
msgid ""
"If the document has a table of contents, clicking on a table of contents "
"item will bring the document to the page linked to that item."
msgstr "បើ​ឯកសារ​មាន​តារាង​មាតិកា ចុច​លើ​តារាង​ធាតុ​មាតិកា​នឹង​នាំ​ឯកសារ​ទៅ​ទំព័រ​ដែល​តភ្ជាប់​ទៅ​ធាតុ​នោះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:131
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Some documents have links. In this case you can click on them and the "
#| "view will change to the page it links to. If the link is to a web page "
#| "the default browser will be invoked."
msgid ""
"Some documents have links. In this case you can click on them and the view "
"will change to the page it links to. If the link is to a web page or some "
"other document the default &kde; handler for that format will be invoked. "
"For example, clicking on a link pointing to <quote>http://www.kde.org</"
"quote> will open the web page in the default &kde;'s web browser."
msgstr ""
"ឯកសារ​ខ្លះ​មាន​តំណ ។ ក្នុង​ករណី​នេះ អ្នក​អាច​ចុច​លើ​ពួក​វា ហើយ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​នឹង​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ទៅ​ទំព័រ​ដែល​វា​តភ្ជាប់​"
"ទៅ ។ បើ​តំណភ្ជាប់​ទៅ​ទំព័រ​តំបន់​បណ្ដាញ កម្មវិធី​រុករក​លំនាំ​ដើម​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ហៅ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you may use the following functionality to quickly move to "
"specific places in the document:"
msgstr "ជា​បន្ថែម អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​មុខងារ​ខាងក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​រហ័ស​ទៅ​កន្លែង​ជាក់លាក់​ក្នុង​ឯកសារ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the first page of the document using <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Home</keycap></keycombo> or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>First Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ទៅ​កាន់​ទំព័រ​ដំបូង​នៃ​ឯកសារ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)"
"<keycap>ផ្ទះ</keycap></keycombo> ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <menuchoice> <guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ទំព័រ​ដំបូង</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the last page of the document using <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>End</keycap></keycombo> or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Last Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ទៅ​កាន់​ទំព័រ​ចុង​ក្រោយ​នៃ​ឯកសារ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <keycombo action=\"simul\">បញ្ជា(Ctrl)"
"<keycap>ចុង</keycap></keycombo> ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <menuchoice> <guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ទំព័រ​ចុង</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can go to the next page of the document using <keycap>Space</keycap>, "
#| "the <guibutton>Next Page</guibutton> Toolbar button or using <menuchoice> "
#| "<guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Next Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can go forward in the document using <keycap>Space</keycap> or "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap>. To go to the next page of the document use the "
"<guibutton>Next Page</guibutton> Toolbar button or <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Next Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> in the menubar."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ទៅ​កាន់​ទំព័រ​បន្ទាប់​នៃ​ឯកសារ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <keycap>ដក​ឃ្លា</keycap> ប៊ូតុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ "
"<guibutton>ទំព័រ​បន្ទាប់</guibutton> ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <menuchoice> <guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ទំព័រ​បន្ទាប់</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can go to the previous page of the document using <keycap>Backspace</"
#| "keycap>, the <guibutton>Previous Page</guibutton> Toolbar button or using "
#| "<menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Previous Page</"
#| "guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can go back in the document using &Backspace; or <keycap>Page Up</"
"keycap>. To go to the previous page of the document use <guibutton>Previous "
"Page</guibutton> Toolbar button or <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Previous Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> in the menubar."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ទៅ​កាន់​ទំព័រ​មុន​នៃ​ឯកសារ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <keycap>លុប​ថយ​ក្រោយ</keycap> ប៊ូតុង​របារ​ឧបករណ៍ "
"<guibutton>ទំព័រ​មុន</guibutton> ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ <menuchoice> <guimenu>ទៅ</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>ទំព័រ​មុន</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "របៀប​បង្ហាញ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Presentation mode represents another way to view PDF documents in "
#| "&kpdf;. It can be enabled in <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
#| "guimenu><guimenuitem>Presentation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. It shows "
#| "the document on a page per page basis. The pages are shown with zoom to "
#| "page, that means all the page is visible."
msgid ""
"The Presentation mode represents another way to view documents in &okular;. "
"It can be enabled in <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Presentation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. It shows the "
"document on a page per page basis. The pages are shown with zoom to page, "
"that means all the page is visible."
msgstr ""
"របៀប​បង្ហាញ​តំណាង​ឲ្យ​វិធី​មួយ​ទៀត​ដើម្បី​មើល​ឯកសារ PDF ក្នុង Kpdf ។វា​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក​ក្នុង "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>ការ​បង្ហាញ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> ។ វា​បង្ហាញ​ឯកសារ​នៅ​លើ​ទំព័រ​ក្នុង​ទំព័រ​មូលដ្ឋាន ។ ទំព័រ​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​ជាមួយ​ការ​ពង្រី​ទៅ​"
"ទំព័រ ដែល​មាន​ន័យ​ថា​ទំព័រ​ទាំងអស់​អាច​មើល​ឃើញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "PDF documents can even specify that they are always opened in "
#| "presentation mode."
msgid ""
"&PDF; documents can even specify that they are always opened in presentation "
"mode."
msgstr "ឯកសារ PDF អាច​បញ្ជាក់​ថា ពួក​វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក​ជានិច្ច​ក្នុង​របៀប​បង្ហាញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When in presentation mode, you have an helper bar located on the top of the "
"screen. Just move the mouse cursor to the top of the screen to make it "
"appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To navigate between pages you may use the &LMB; (next page) and the &RMB; "
